  "releaseNotes": "[Add] ClassKind enumeration interning every SysML v2 metaclass name as the frozen identifier used by the class_kind table of the SQL schema\n            [Add] Direction enumeration of the PSM, with the in, out and both literals (#404)\n            [Update] PSM Page is an immutable, opaque page token as defined in Clause 8.1.3, created with FromCursor and decoded with TryDecode; the Epoch and Identifier properties are removed (#404)",
